commit 93c366551322042273263d8d02f2d53884988d46

C03: bringing an authenticated application to the front is window.focus over its resolved window (WINDOWS1385)

«traé chrome al frente», «enfocá chrome», «bring Chrome to the front» reached no reader: only the close request knew authenticated application targets.

effect_intent: _authenticated_application_focus_target / resolve_application_focus_name (a focus-only head such as «enfocá», «focus», «switch to», or a carry/put head with the front tail, over one exact catalog identity, reusing the close target forms); resolve_explicit_effects proposes window.focus, whose prerequisite window.resolve binds the window; the window.resolve domain accepts the focus target.
__main__._explicit_arguments_from_evidence: window.resolve grounds applicationName from the focus target as well as the close target.
effect_intent._is_direct_request: the request-head alternation gains the focus heads (trae, traeme, traer, lleva, llevar, bring, enfoca, enfocame, enfocar, focus, switch to); without them effect_request_is_authoritative denied every focus form except «poné», as the offline probe showed.
llm._CAUSE_FACT window_not_found: «nothing was done to it» instead of «nothing was closed», since the fact now serves focus requests too.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


